<div id="q-resource-allocation" class="question">
  <div class="answer">

  <p>FAIR is a central part of our data management; it is considered at every decision in our data management plan. We use the FAIR data process ourselves to make our use of the data as efficient as possible.</p>

  {# Cost #}
    <ul>
    {%- for project in data.dmp.projects -%}
      {%- if project.costs|length > 0 -%}
      <li>
        <strong>{{ project.name._value if project.name._value else "(no name given)" }}</strong>:
        <p>Following resources will be dedicated to data management and ensuring that data will be FAIR:</p>
        <ul>
          {%- for cost in project.costs -%}
            <li>
              <p><b>{{ cost.title._value if cost.title._value else "(no name given)" }}:</b>
              {%- if cost.amount._value is not none -%}
                &nbsp;{{ cost.amount._value }} {{ " " + cost.currency._value if cost.currency._value else "(no currency given)" }}
              {%- else -%}
                (no amount given)
              {%- endif %}
              {%- if cost.allocation|length > 0 -%}
                <br>This will be used for: 
                  {{ cost.allocation | join(", ") }}.
              {%- endif %}

              {# How cost will be covered #}
              {%- if cost.isCoveredByGrant._value is sameas true -%}
                  <br>This cost will be covered by funding from grant <em>{{ cost.coveredBy._label if cost.coveredBy._label else "(no grant given)" }}.</em>
              {%- elif cost.isCoveredByGrant._value is sameas false and cost.coveredBy -%}
                <br>This cost will be covered by <em>{{cost.coveredBy._value}}</em>.
              {%- endif %}
              </p>
            </li>
          {%- endfor %}
        </ul>
      </li>
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
    </ul>

  {# Additional tools/software #}
  {%- set unavailableToolsUnique = [] -%}
  {%- set toolNames = [] -%}
  {%- for dataset in data.dmp.datasets -%}
    {%- for tool in dataset.tools -%}
      {%- if tool.isAvailableInInstitution._value is sameas false and tool.name._value not in toolNames -%}
        {%- do unavailableToolsUnique.append(tool) -%}
        {%- do toolNames.append(tool.name._value) -%}
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
  {%- if unavailableToolsUnique|length > 0 -%}
    <p>We require the following tool or software in addition to what is usually available in the institute: {{ unavailableToolsUnique|map(attribute='name._value')|join(', ') }}.</p>
  {%- else -%}
    <p>We do not require any hardware or software in addition to what is usually available in the institute.</p>
  {%- endif -%}

  {# Archiving (Cold storage) #}
  {%- if data.dmp.datasets|length > 0 -%}
    <p>The following part describes how data will be archived and preserved for the long term, including funding sources and minimum retention periods for each dataset:</p>
      <ul>
      {%- for dataset in data.dmp.datasets -%}
        <li>
        {%- if dataset.name -%}
          <strong>{{ macros.integrationValue(dataset.name) }}</strong>
        {%- else -%}
            <strong>(no name given)</strong>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if dataset.preservationStrategy -%}
          <p>
          {%- if dataset.preservationStrategy.usesLongTermStorageDuringProject._value is sameas true and dataset.preservationStrategy.usesLongTermStorageAfterProject._value is sameas true %}
            We will be archiving data (using so-called 'cold storage') for long term preservation after the {{globals.projects}} but also already during the {{globals.projects}}.
          {%- elif dataset.preservationStrategy.usesLongTermStorageDuringProject._value is sameas true %}
            We will be archiving data (using so-called 'cold storage') for long term preservation already during the {{globals.projects}}.
          {%- elif dataset.preservationStrategy.usesLongTermStorageAfterProject._value is sameas true %}
            We will be archiving data (using so-called 'cold storage') for long term preservation after the {{globals.projects}}.
          {%- endif -%}

          {%- if dataset.preservationStrategy.usesLongTermStorageAfterProject._value is sameas true -%}
            {%- if dataset.preservationStrategy.longTermStorageAfterProject -%}
              {%- set longTermStorageAfterProject = dataset.preservationStrategy.longTermStorageAfterProject -%}
              {# Paying #}
              {%- if longTermStorageAfterProject.funder._value == "grant" %}
                The costs for archiving data will be paid from the grant.
              {%- elif longTermStorageAfterProject.funder._value == "department" %}
                The costs for archiving data will be paid out of departmental budgets from one or more of the {{globals.projects}} participants.
              {%- elif longTermStorageAfterProject.funder._value == "institute" %}
                The used data archiving service is budgeted by one or more of the participating institutes.
              {%- endif -%}
            {%- endif -%}

            {# Lifetime #}
            {%- if longTermStorageAfterProject.minimumLifeTimeYears._value == "5" %}
              The minimum lifetime of the archive is 5 years.
            {%- elif longTermStorageAfterProject.minimumLifeTimeYears._value == "10" %}
              The minimum lifetime of the archive is 10 years.
            {%- elif longTermStorageAfterProject.minimumLifeTimeYears._value == "15" %}
              The minimum lifetime of the archive is 15 years.
            {%- elif longTermStorageAfterProject.minimumLifeTimeYears._value -%}
              {%- set end = " year." if (longTermStorageAfterProject.minimumLifeTimeYears._value == "1") else " years." %}
              The minimum lifetime of the archive is {{longTermStorageAfterProject.minimumLifeTimeYears._value}} {{end}}
            {%- elif longTermStorageAfterProject.minimumLifeTimeOther._value  %}
              The minimum lifetime of the archive is specially arranged {{longTermStorageAfterProject.minimumLifeTimeOther._value}} .
            {%- endif -%}

            {# Extending #}
            {%- if longTermStorageAfterProject.isArchivalPeriodExtendable._value is sameas true -%}
              {%- set archivalPeriodExtension = longTermStorageAfterProject.archivalPeriodExtension -%}
              {%- if archivalPeriodExtension.archivalExtensionDecisionMaker._value == "principle_investigator" %}
                The archival period can be extended &ndash; one of the principle investigators involved in the {{globals.projects}} will decide.
              {%- elif archivalPeriodExtension.archivalExtensionDecisionMaker._value == "archive_staff" %}
                The archival period can be extended &ndash; library or archive staff will decide.
              {%- endif -%}

              {%- set criteria = "" -%}
              {%- set actual = 'actual' in archivalPeriodExtension.archivalExtensionDecisionCriteria if archivalPeriodExtension.archivalExtensionDecisionCriteria else false -%}
              {%- set predicted = 'predicted' in archivalPeriodExtension.archivalExtensionDecisionCriteria if archivalPeriodExtension.archivalExtensionDecisionCriteria else false -%}
              {%- set budget = 'budget' in archivalPeriodExtension.archivalExtensionDecisionCriteria if archivalPeriodExtension.archivalExtensionDecisionCriteria else false -%}
              {%- if actual and predicted -%}
                {%- set criteria = "both the actual and predicted use of the archived data" -%}
              {%- elif actual -%}
                {%- set criteria = "the actual use of the archived data" -%}
              {%- elif predicted -%}
                {%- set criteria = "the predicted use of the archived data" -%}
              {%- endif -%}
              {%- if budget and criteria %}
                The decision whether or not to extend the renewal be based on available budget as well as  ~ {{criteria}}.
              {%- elif budget %}
                The decision whether or not to extend the renewal be based on available budget.
              {%- elif actual or predicted %}
                The decision whether or not to extend the renewal be based on {{criteria}}.
              {%- endif -%}

            {%- elif longTermStorageAfterProject.isArchivalPeriodExtendable._value is sameas false -%}
              {%- if longTermStorageAfterProject.noArchivalPeriodExtensionReason._value == "law" %}
                The archival period cannot be extended as it is limited by law or contract.
              {%- elif longTermStorageAfterProject.noArchivalPeriodExtensionReason._value == "cost" %}
                The archival period cannot be extended as it is limited by budget.
              {%- endif -%}
            {%- endif -%}

            {# Upgrades (format) #}
            {%- if longTermStorageAfterProject.isFormatUpgradePlanned._value is sameas true %}
              Data formats of data in cold storage will be upgraded if they become obsolete.
            {%- elif longTermStorageAfterProject.isFormatUpgradePlanned._value is sameas false %}
              Data formats of data in cold storage will not be upgraded over time.
            {%- endif -%}

            {# Upgrades (media) #}
            {%- if longTermStorageAfterProject.isMediaUpgradePlanned._value is sameas true %}
              Archived data will be migrated regularly to more modern storage media (e.g. newer tapes).
            {%- elif longTermStorageAfterProject.isMediaUpgradePlanned._value is sameas false %}
              Archived data will not be migrated to other storage media over time.
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endif -%}
          </p>
        {%- endif -%}
          <p>No specific measures for long-term preservation have been defined.</p>
        </li>
      {%- endfor -%}
      </ul>
    {%- endif -%}
    
    {# Contributors and responsibilities #}
    {%- set contributors = data.dmp.collaboration.contributors -%}
    {%- if contributors|length > 0 -%}
      {%- set roles = {} -%}
      {%- for contributor in contributors -%}
        {%- set name = contributor.name._value if contributor.name and contributor.name._value else "(no name given)" -%}
        {%- if contributor.roles and contributor.roles|length > 0 -%}
          {%- for role in contributor.roles -%}
            {%- set role_name = role if role else "(no role given)" -%}
            {%- if roles[role_name] is defined -%}
              {%- set _ = roles[role_name].append(name) -%}
            {%- else -%}
              {%- set _ = roles.update({role_name: [name]}) -%}
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
        {%- else -%}
          {%- set role_name = "(no role given)" -%}
          {%- if roles[role_name] is defined -%}
            {%- set _ = roles[role_name].append(name) -%}
          {%- else -%}
            {%- set _ = roles.update({role_name: [name]}) -%}
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endfor -%}

      {# Role definitions mapping #}
      {%- set role_definitions = {
        "Project Manager": "responsible for implementing the DMP, and ensuring it is reviewed and revised.",
        "Data Curator": "responsible for reviewing, enhancing, cleaning, or standardizing metadata and the associated data submitted for storage, use and maintenance within a data centre or repository.",
        "Data Collector": "responsible for finding, gathering, and collecting data.",
        "Data Manager": "responsible for maintaining the finished resource.",
        "Data Steward": "responsible for the management and proficiency of data including data processing, data policies, data guidelines, and data availability.",
        "Distributor": "responsible for generating and disseminating copies of the resource in either electronic or print form.",
        "Data Protection Officer": "responsible for all issues relating to the protection of personal data and data protection policies in general.",
        "Contact Person": "responsible for responding to inquiries regarding the resource and providing additional information when necessary.",
        "Editor": "responsible for reviewing, revising, and preparing content for publication or distribution, ensuring quality and consistency.",
        "Producer": "responsible for overseeing the production of the data or resource, including managing workflows, quality, and outputs.",
        "Project Leader": "responsible for overall direction, strategic decisions, and the success of the project.",
        "Project Member": "responsible for contributing to the execution of the project tasks under the guidance of project leadership.",
        "Researcher": "responsible for conducting research activities, generating and analyzing data, and contributing domain expertise.",
        "Rights Holder": "responsible for holding the legal rights to the data or resource, including intellectual property or licensing.",
        "Sponsor": "responsible for funding or supporting the project, either financially or through in-kind contributions.",
        "Supervisor": "responsible for overseeing and mentoring researchers or team members to ensure scientific and ethical integrity.",
        "Work Package Leader": "responsible for coordinating a specific work package within a larger project, ensuring tasks and deliverables are met.",
        "Creator of DMP": "responsible for drafting and maintaining the Data Management Plan (DMP), ensuring alignment with funder and institutional policies.",
        "Other": "responsible for contributing to the project in a role that does not fall under the standard set of defined responsibilities, but is essential to its success."
      } -%}

      {%- if roles|length > 0 -%}
      Contributors and their responsibilities within the {{ globals.projects }}:
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- for role, names in roles.items() -%}
        {%- if names|length > 0 -%}
        <p>
          {%- set nNames = names|length -%}
          {%- if nNames > 2 -%}
          {{ names[0:-1]|join(", ") }}, and {{ names[-1] }} are
          {%- elif nNames == 2 -%}
          {{ names[0] }} and {{ names[1] }} are
          {%- else -%}
          {{ names[0] }} is
          {%- endif -%}
          {# Print definition if available, else fallback to role name #}
          {{ role_definitions[role] if role_definitions[role] is defined else role }}
        </p>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
      {%- endif -%}

    {# Additional expertise #}
    {%- set collaboration = data.dmp.collaboration -%}
    {%- if collaboration.expertiseRequirement._value == "no" -%}
      <p>To execute the DMP, no additional specialist expertise is required.</p>
    {%- elif collaboration.expertiseRequirement._value == "trainedStaffAvailable" -%}
      <p>To execute the DMP, additional specialist expertise is required and we have such trained support staff available.</p>
    {%- elif collaboration.expertiseRequirement._value == "trainingExistingStaff" -%}
      <p>
        To execute the DMP, additional specialist expertise is required. We will be training existing staff
        {%- if collaboration.trainingDetails %}
          in: {{ collaboration.trainingDetails._value  }}
        {%- endif -%}.
      </p>
    {%- elif collaboration.expertiseRequirement._value == "hiringNewStaff" -%}
      <p>
        To execute the DMP, additional specialist expertise is required. We will be hiring new people with additional expertise
        {%- if collaboration.expertiseDetails %}
          in: {{ collaboration.expertiseDetails._value }}
        {%- endif -%}.
      </p>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</div>
